Third-party source copied into this repository
==============================================

Three of the frontend cells were built by running another project's scaffold or
registry command, which writes source files into the consuming repository rather
than installing them into node_modules. Those files stay under their upstream
licenses, and the entries below name each one: the paths, the upstream project,
its license, and the copyright notice as the upstream publishes it. Everything
in this repository that is not covered by an entry below is the work of the
copyright holder named above.


frontends/shadcn/
-----------------
Upstream: shadcn-ui/chatbot-template
          https://github.com/shadcn-ui/chatbot-template
License:  MIT

    Copyright (c) 2026 shadcn

This cell was created by adapting the template, so the whole directory is
template source except where noted. Unmodified template source: all fifteen
files in `components/ui/`, `components/theme-provider.tsx`, `app/globals.css`,
`app/layout.tsx`, `app/typeset.css`, `lib/utils.ts`, `components.json`,
`tsconfig.json`, `postcss.config.mjs`, `.prettierrc`, `.prettierignore`,
`.gitignore` and `AGENTS.md`. Modified template source: the components that draw
the chat, `app/page.tsx`, `next.config.ts`, `package.json`, `README.md` and
`.env.example`. Written for this repository:
`components/parts/weather-part.tsx`, `components/parts/notes-part.tsx`,
`components/parts/analyze-part.tsx`, `lib/backend.ts`, `lib/messages.ts`,
`wrangler.jsonc` and `CLAUDE.md`.


