frontends/assistant-ui/
-----------------------
Upstream: assistant-ui
          https://github.com/assistant-ui/assistant-ui
License:  MIT

    Copyright (c) 2025 AgentbaseAI Inc.

The ten files in `components/assistant-ui/` came from the assistant-ui registry.
The cell was scaffolded with the project's `create` command, so `app/`,
`components.json`, `postcss.config.mjs` and `tsconfig.json` are modified
scaffold output. `lib/utils.ts` is the shadcn `cn` helper. Written for this
repository: `lib/backend.ts`, `components/theme-provider.tsx`, `next.config.js`,
`wrangler.jsonc`, `README.md` and `CLAUDE.md`.


